{"title":"English Conversation & Coffee","startsAt":"2026-10-27T19:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-27T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us every Tuesday night at a coffee shop to practice conversation, while enjoying a cup of coffee or tea together. Our topics change each week, but the English practice does not! We are always open for Q & A (question and answer) about Canadian culture, life in the greater Toronto area, or anything else you can think of!","venue":{"name":"Second Cup Café","address":"727 Central Pkwy W, Mississauga","lat":43.575645,"lng":-79.645889,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"Mississauga English Conversation Community","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/b/5/7/highres_497987959.jpeg"}